      <rules>
        <rule name="Know Thine Enemy" id="30c7-e913-2e44-c790" hidden="false">
          <description>The Dark Angels player may, if they choose, demand that their opponent set up D6 units before any of the Dark Angels deploy. The Dark Angel&apos;s player may pick which D6 units are affected, even if units must normally be deployed in a special order during the mission set-up.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Weaken Resolve" id="bd63-d267-f375-9e9f" hidden="false">
          <description>Attempt to use this power when an enemy unit with a model within 12&quot; has to take a Morale check. On a successful Psychic test then the enemy unit must take its Morale check on a 3D6 added together. This power may only be used once per player turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
